<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-pietak-bioelectric-morphogen-coupling> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Pietak & Levin (2017) electrodiffusive Nernst-Planck gap-junction morphogen transport & cryptic two-headed memory (Dugesia japonica / Schmidtea mediterranea freshwater planarian flatworm)",
        "Pietak & Levin (2017) electrodiffusive Nernst-Planck gap-junction morphogen transport & cryptic two-headed memory faithfully reproduces Dugesia japonica / Schmidtea mediterranea freshwater planarian flatworm morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/pietak-bioelectric-morphogen-coupling-1>,
