    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2017-pietak-bioelectric-morphogen-coupling.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Dugesia japonica / Schmidtea mediterranea freshwater planarian flatworm specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 58.1/100, audit 2026-10-19-bioelectric-morphogen-coupling-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2017-pietak-bioelectric-morphogen-coupling.py> ;
    schema:about "Dugesia japonica / Schmidtea mediterranea freshwater planarian flatworm" ;
